{
  "name": "Invoice Intake and Approval Queue",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lane 1: intake never waits\n\nEvery invoice email is read, its fields extracted, and it joins the queue as PENDING, even while another invoice is waiting for a decision.\n\nThe duplicate key is a SHA-256 of vendor, invoice number and amount. The same PDF forwarded twice produces the same key, so it is recognised instead of queued again.",
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 280
      },
      "id": "57483918-23cc-49d4-b5e0-2761ea01df2f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lane 2: one decision at a time\n\nEvery 15 minutes the oldest PENDING invoice goes to the approver. **If any invoice is already IN_REVIEW, the run does nothing.** That one check is the whole queue lock.\n\nApprove records it in the masterfile and tells accounts. Decline marks it DISAPPROVED. No answer within two days puts it back to PENDING, so a missed email never silently rejects an invoice.\n\nSet INVOICE_APPROVER_EMAIL and ACCOUNTS_TEAM_EMAIL. The spreadsheet needs a Queue sheet and a Masterfile sheet.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 390
      },
      "id": "78ed315f-9f2b-46a5-84f9-67f378a08606",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyX",
              "value": 5,
              "unit": "minutes"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment filename:pdf subject:invoice",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "b6beeb41-affe-4357-b943-7ac1b98498da",
      "name": "[I0] Invoice Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
        "options": {
          "joinPages": true
        }
      },
      "id": "c3b87db6-0a14-4ee0-9959-af9e9eb9a694",
      "name": "[I1] Read PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        260,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "schemaType": "fromAttributes",
        "attributes": {
          "attributes": [
            {
              "name": "vendor",
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The company that issued the invoice",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "invoiceNumber",
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The invoice number exactly as printed",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "amount",
              "type": "number",
              "description": "The total amount due, as a number with no currency symbol",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "name": "currency",
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The three-letter currency code, for example MYR"
            },
            {
              "name": "dueDate",
              "type": "date",
              "description": "The payment due date"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8e8b9859-4f31-4c45-9afe-203b7a7ac589",
      "name": "[I2] Extract Invoice Fields",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.informationExtractor",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "efb8bf76-2eed-4bd3-90b8-d9f2a7561d01",
      "name": "Extraction Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        520,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hash",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.output.vendor.toLowerCase().trim() }}|{{ $json.output.invoiceNumber.trim() }}|{{ $json.output.amount }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "invoiceKey"
      },
      "id": "88684cd6-0db1-4c6b-99ce-2b68db16b090",
      "name": "[I3] Invoice Key",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
